# Three-Column Layout for Focus Page

Modify the Focus page layout to ensure the immersive vinyl player is fully visible without scrolling.

## Proposed Changes

### Focus Page [MODIFY] [page.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/focus/page.tsx)

- Transition to a three-column layout (`[Vinyl] | [Timer] | [Tasks]`) when Spotify is enabled.
- **Layout Logic**:
  - `enableSpotify` = true: Container width increases (e.g., `max-w-6xl`), and a new third column is added for the vinyl player on the far left.
  - `enableSpotify` = false: Original two-column layout (`max-w-4xl`).
- Remove the vinyl player from the second column (Timer column).
- Adjust spacing and borders to maintain the "Dense Terminal" aesthetic.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Verify that the layout shifts correctly when Spotify is enabled/disabled.
- Ensure the vinyl player and timer are both fully visible without vertical scrolling in the main container.
- Check responsiveness on smaller screens.
